      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;How ClaudeBot brought my Gogs server to its knees and taught me about the hidden costs of the AI gold rush&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;picture style=&#34;display: block; text-align: center; margin: 2rem auto;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;source media=&#34;(max-width: 480px)&#34; srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/posts/2025/ai_crawlers/cpu_usage_hu_1f322cbc236d2a69.jpg&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;source media=&#34;(max-width: 800px)&#34; srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/posts/2025/ai_crawlers/cpu_usage_hu_29ea70d853da090b.jpg&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;source media=&#34;(min-width: 801px)&#34; srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/posts/2025/ai_crawlers/cpu_usage_hu_16a6eafdba3168be.jpg&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img &#xA;      src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/posts/2025/ai_crawlers/cpu_usage_hu_16a6eafdba3168be.jpg&#34; &#xA;      alt=&#34;When AI Crawlers Attack: A Server Performance Horror Story&#34; &#xA;      width=&#34;600&#34; &#xA;      height=&#34;413&#34;&#xA;      style=&#34;max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; display: block;&#34;&#xA;      class=&#34;responsive-image&#34;&#xA;      loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;  &lt;/picture&gt;</description>
